{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>90年代性感女神邱淑貞兩名愛女沈月與22歲二女沈日近日激罕合體，為時尚品牌拍攝宣傳照大晒超高顏值。這對被譽為擁 …</p><p></p>\n<p>90年代性感女神邱淑貞兩名愛女沈月與22歲二女沈日近日激罕合體，為時尚品牌拍攝宣傳照大晒超高顏值。這對被譽為擁有最強星二代基因姊妹花同框鬥靚，展現截然不同時尚魅力。照片一出瞬間引發大批網民瘋狂轉發並討論二人外表特徵。</p>\n<h2>沈月沈日激罕合體展現截然不同時尚魅力</h2>\n<p>從最新曝光全身照可見，兩姊妹悠閒並肩坐在床邊展現不同穿搭風格。大女沈月留着一頭烏黑長直髮，身穿灰白迷彩寬鬆T恤配搭短褲與波鞋，微側身靠向妹妹並交疊雙腿，大晒白滑修長美腿。身旁二妹沈日則綁上雙麻花辮，以藍色條紋襯衫內搭卡通T恤，配襯迷彩長襪與紫色波鞋，手持手機對鏡自拍盡顯美式街頭潮味。另外更有沈月身穿墨灰色洗水牛仔褸內搭螢光黃上衣配黑色皮革迷你裙造型，沈日亦有換上綠黑格仔恤衫內搭白色露腰短T恤配牛仔短褲。</p>\n<h2>兩姊妹鏡頭前瘋狂賣萌大騷深厚姊妹情誼</h2>\n<p>面對外界高度關注，當事人未有發表任何官方文字回應，僅透過一連串近距離自拍互動向外界展示深厚感情。相中沈月輕搭妹妹香肩，一時對鏡頭俏皮眨眼，一時展露甜美微笑，眉眼間帶有邱淑貞年輕時神采。負責掌鏡拍攝沈日連環做出驚喜及嘟嘴賣萌表情，舉手投足間充滿青春活力。兩人在鏡頭前貼頭自拍，皮膚白皙緊緻，展現甜美與俏皮兩種截然不同風格。</p>\n<h2>邱淑貞九十年代性感形象深入民心獲激讚</h2>\n<p>擁有極高知名度母親邱淑貞曾是90年代炙手可熱性感女神，婚後與丈夫沈嘉偉育有三名女兒，一家五口生活一直備受外界關注。其中大女沈月自成年後便頻繁出席各大時尚活動，憑藉精緻五官與極佳身材比例，一直被外界稱為最美星二代。至於現年22歲二女沈日過去相對低調，早前曾穿上貼身背心外遊展現健康性感一面，臉型輪廓神似媽媽，兩姊妹外貌均帶有父母輪廓特徵。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入留言區洗版狂推最美星二代姊妹</h2>\n<p>兩姊妹絕密合照在社交平台曝光後，隨即吸引大批網民湧入留言區瘋狂洗版。大批網民被這對姊妹花高顏值吸引，紛紛留言大讚「最美姊妹花」、「兩個都好靚女」以及「各具獨特美態」。不少討論區亦有開帖討論兩人外貌，網民普遍指出大女沈月散發甜美溫柔氣質，而二女沈日則展現健康陽光氣息，兩人在網絡上成功引起極大迴響。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948237290613233_7750762656afad63193eaf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_902227086_18645618439014602_8504721882871515263_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948237290613233_7750762656afad63193eaf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yatsham）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373162441113_5635471816afad6341d695.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤鋒 老婆 陳麗麗 再懷孕 高齡產婦 邱淑貞的三位千金「月、日、晨」都被稱為盡得媽媽優良基因，其中長女沈月更被譽為最美的星二代。（圖片來源：邱淑貞微博）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373162441113_5635471816afad6341d695.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>邱淑貞的三位千金「月、日、晨」都被稱為盡得媽媽優良基因，其中長女沈月更被譽為最美的星二代。（圖片來源：邱淑貞微博）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373293436207_16194047776afad6356e5a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"邱淑貞 沈日 邱淑貞大女沈月完美複製媽媽樣靚身形正，被封為「最美星二代」，次女沈日亦開始鑽研打扮。（圖片來源：IG@yuetyuetxx）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373293436207_16194047776afad6356e5a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>邱淑貞大女沈月完美複製媽媽樣靚身形正，被封為「最美星二代」，次女沈日亦開始鑽研打扮。（圖片來源：IG@yuetyuetxx）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373433551841_14634103146afad636f3d34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_894460947_18645618535014602_3966946996592790990_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373433551841_14634103146afad636f3d34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yatsham）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794823736569940_15853988086afad6394092a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_901172555_18645618430014602_2263623699142828956_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794823736569940_15853988086afad6394092a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yatsham）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373882417059_4779826046afad63b5dbf3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_902174656_18645618592014602_8575213918715378358_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482373882417059_4779826046afad63b5dbf3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yatsham）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482374110093963_12435980686afad63d88d2f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SaveClip_App_902601562_18645618526014602_3120426388618867902_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482374110093963_12435980686afad63d88d2f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yatsham）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b2%88%e6%97%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">沈日</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b2%88%e6%9c%88/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">沈月</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%82%b1%e6%b7%91%e8%b2%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">邱淑貞</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544098\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:37:01.105289+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1445,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:32:07.542883+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:39.057436+00:00","content_hash":"203becf397a4ef647c6ff83ef749b7983fd90896199ba6c53066d2b2da107834","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}